---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Contact" description="Get in touch with Erdem to discuss your data analytics and business intelligence needs.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="label">Get in Touch</span>
      <h1>Let's talk about <span class="cyan">your data.</span></h1>
      <p style="margin-top:16px;max-width:480px;">Tell us about your organization and the challenges you're facing. We respond within one business day.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:48px;align-items:start;">
      <div>
        <h3 style="color:var(--white);margin-bottom:8px;">Send us a message</h3>
        <p style="margin-bottom:28px;font-size:0.9rem;">We'll come back with a clear view of what an Erdem engagement could look like for your organization.</p>
        <form name="contact" method="POST" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px;">
          <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="contact"/>
          <p style="display:none;"><label>Skip: <input name="bot-field"/></label></p>
          <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;">
            <div class="form-group"><label>Full Name *</label><input type="text" name="name" required placeholder="Jane Mwangi"/></div>
            <div class="form-group"><label>Organization *</label><input type="text" name="organization" required placeholder="Nairobi SACCO Ltd"/></div>
          </div>
          <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;">
            <div class="form-group"><label>Email *</label><input type="email" name="email" required placeholder="jane@sacco.co.ke"/></div>
            <div class="form-group"><label>Sector</label>
              <select name="sector">
                <option value="">Select your sector</option>
                <option>SACCO / Microfinance</option><option>Manufacturing</option><option>Distribution</option>
                <option>Multi-Branch Retail</option><option>Insurance</option><option>NGO / Development</option><option>Other</option>
              </select>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="form-group"><label>Service of Interest</label>
            <select name="service">
              <option value="">What are you looking for?</option>
              <option>Business Dashboards & Analysis</option><option>AI Agents & Data Automation</option>
              <option>Predictive Modeling</option><option>Location-Based Insights</option>
              <option>Survey & Feedback Analysis</option><option>Data Collection & Organization</option><option>Not sure yet</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="form-group"><label>Tell us about your data challenge *</label>
            <textarea name="message" required rows="5" placeholder="What data are you working with? What decisions are you struggling to make? What's currently taking too long?"></textarea>
          </div>
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-cyan" style="width:100%;justify-content:center;padding:15px;">Send Message →</button>
        </form>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px;">
        <div style="padding:28px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--r-lg);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">
          <h4 style="color:var(--white);font-size:0.82rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.08em;margin-bottom:20px;">Direct Contact</h4>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;margin-bottom:16px;">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--cyan)" stroke-width="1.5" style="flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px"><path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"/><polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"/></svg>
            <div><div style="font-size:0.72rem;color:var(--dim);margin-bottom:3px;">Email</div><a href="mailto:hello@erdem.co.ke" style="font-size:0.92rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--cyan);">hello@erdem.co.ke</a></div>
          </div>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;margin-bottom:16px;">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--cyan)" stroke-width="1.5" style="flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07A19.5 19.5 0 0 1 4.69 12 19.79 19.79 0 0 1 1.61 3.5 2 2 0 0 1 3.59 1.3h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.127.96.361 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L7.91 8.96a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l.92-.92a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.907.339 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 21.73 16.92z"/></svg>
            <div><div style="font-size:0.72rem;color:var(--dim);margin-bottom:3px;">WhatsApp</div><a href="https://wa.me/254716404849?text=Hi%20Erdem%2C%20I%27d%20like%20to%20discuss%20my%20data%20needs." target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="font-size:0.92rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--cyan);">+254 716 404 849</a></div>
          </div>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--cyan)" stroke-width="1.5" style="flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg>
            <div><div style="font-size:0.72rem;color:var(--dim);margin-bottom:3px;">Location</div><div style="font-size:0.92rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--white);">Nairobi, Kenya</div><div style="font-size:0.78rem;color:var(--dim);margin-top:2px;">Serving all of East Africa</div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="padding:28px;border:1px solid var(--b-cyan);border-radius:var(--r-lg);background:rgba(0,212,224,0.04);">
          <h4 style="color:var(--white);font-size:0.87rem;margin-bottom:16px;">What happens next?</h4>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;margin-bottom:12px;"><div style="min-width:22px;height:22px;background:var(--cyan);border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:0.72rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--bg);">1</div><p style="font-size:0.87rem;">We review and reply within one business day.</p></div>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;margin-bottom:12px;"><div style="min-width:22px;height:22px;background:var(--cyan);border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:0.72rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--bg);">2</div><p style="font-size:0.87rem;">Short discovery call to understand your data and goals.</p></div>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;"><div style="min-width:22px;height:22px;background:var(--cyan);border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:0.72rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--bg);">3</div><p style="font-size:0.87rem;">Clear proposal — what we build, timeline, and retainer structure.</p></div>
        </div>
        <a href="https://wa.me/254716404849?text=Hi%20Erdem%2C%20I%27d%20like%20to%20discuss%20my%20data%20needs." target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-cyan" style="width:100%;justify-content:center;padding:15px;">💬 Chat on WhatsApp</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
<style>@media(max-width:900px){[style*="grid-template-columns:1fr 360px"],[style*="grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr"]{grid-template-columns:1fr!important}}</style>
